Silt REPL (type :quit to exit, :help for commands)
Commands:
  :help, :h    Show this help
  :quit, :q    Exit the REPL
  <Tab>        Autocomplete builtins and user-defined names

Enter expressions to evaluate, or declarations (fn, type, trait, import).
Multi-line input: an open brace, paren, bracket, string or block comment continues on the next line.
A brace in a string starts an interpolation: write \{ for the character itself.
